@startuml 02-diagrama-despliegue
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
}

actor Usuario

node "VM Azure (Linux)" as VM {

  node "Docker Engine (docker-compose)" as Docker {

    node "Contenedor: frontend\n(Nginx + build de React)" as N_Front {
      component [SPA React] as App_Front
    }

    node "Contenedor: backend\n(Node.js + Express)" as N_Back {
      component [API REST] as App_Back
      component [Fabric SDK] as App_SDK
    }

    node "Contenedor: mongodb" as N_Mongo {
      folder "Volumen: mongo-data" as V_Mongo
      database "MongoDB" as DB_Mongo
    }

    package "Red Hyperledger Fabric (contenedores Docker)" {
      node "Contenedor: ca.org1" as N_CA
      node "Contenedor: orderer.example.com" as N_Orderer
      node "Contenedor: peer0.org1" as N_Peer {
        folder "Volumen: ledger del peer" as V_Peer
        component [Chaincode (Go)] as CC
        database "CouchDB\n(state database)" as CouchDB
      }
      note as N_Canal
        Canal: <nombre de tu canal>
        Chaincode: <nombre del chaincode>
      end note
    }
  }
}

cloud "Servidor SMTP\n(correo)" as SMTP

Usuario --> App_Front : HTTPS :443
App_Front --> App_Back : REST/JSON (HTTPS) :3000
App_Back --> DB_Mongo : Driver MongoDB :27017
App_Back --> App_SDK
App_Back --> SMTP : SMTP/TLS (envio token 2FA)
App_SDK --> N_Peer : gRPC :7051 (invoke / query)
App_SDK --> N_Orderer : gRPC :7050 (envio de transacciones)
N_Peer --> CouchDB : :5984
N_CA --> N_Peer : emision de certificados (MSP) :7054
N_CA --> N_Orderer : emision de certificados (MSP) :7054

note bottom
  RNF-021: todos los componentes se ejecutan
  como contenedores Docker orquestados con
  Docker Compose, sobre una VM Azure durante
  1 mes (topologia de una sola organizacion,
  segun el alcance del MVP).
end note
@enduml
